      "sourceTextSha256": "7c69b244b25ba4d3012351a4a969ac62b2505d01eb308dc545bad271cbd716e5",
      "text": "Important Note About Scheduling:  Please be aware that some museums and attractions in Mexico are closed on Mondays, and certain activities may only be available on specific days of the week. If your itinerary includes a Monday or overlaps with a day when an activity is unavailable, we may need to adjust the order of visits to ensure the best experience. Our team will always prioritize maintaining the quality and flow of the program while accommodating any local scheduling constraints. Thank you for your understanding and flexibility.",
